    "What score did the clinician give this patient on the CCAS questionnaire digit span backwards question? If no score is given in the text, respond \"-1\"":"digit span backwards clinician",
    "What score did the clinician give this patient on the CCAS questionnaire cube draw/cube copy question? If no score is given in the text, respond \"-1\"":"cube draw/copy clinician",
    "What score did the clinician give this patient on the CCAS questionnaire verbal recall question? If no score is given in the text, respond \"-1\"":"verbal recall clinician",
    "What score did the clinician give this patient on the CCAS questionnaire similarities question? If no score is given in the text, respond \"-1\"":"similarities clinician",
